# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Administration workbooks never belong in this repository.
# The patient master sheet and the inventory workbooks hold personal data and
# organisational secrets. Their STRUCTURE is published (v6/src/inventory_data.js,
# v6/src/master_registry.js, v6/src/master_analysis.js); the files are not.
# Root-level spreadsheets are ignored outright; v6/examples keeps its blank,
# demo-only import template, which is tracked deliberately.
